g prompts, the next agent MUST:**\n1. Read `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\omni-flash-policy-bypass\\SKILL.md` — this skill is specifically designed for writing Omni Flash prompts that bypass policy filters for weapons/violence content\n2. Read `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\ai-ad-prompt-guide\\SKILL.md` — covers universal prompting rules and model-specific guidance\n3. Read `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\anti-sycophancy\\SKILL.md` — anti-sycophancy is ALWAYS active for Priyanshu. Prefix responses with \"Priyanshu,\". No empty praise.\n\n**The 5 videos and likely best test scenes:**\n1. Banned Weapons — macuahuitl cold open (stickman swings obsidian club)\n2. Banned Books — dictionary being pulled from shelf with red \"BANNED\" stamp\n3. Dumb War Tactics — some absurd military maneuver\n4. Greek Mythology Monsters — a creature reveal (Typhon, Ophiotaurus, etc.)\n5. Bullet Types — cross-section bullet impact/mushrooming\n\n**Style requirements:** Dark background, stickman animation aesthetic, must feel like the channel's visual identity. These are TEST clips to see if AI video can produce stickman-style content that doesn't look like AI slop.\n\n### AFTER PROMPTS: Pending Queue\n1. Fix project_brief.md line 113 (research status)\n2. Character design (generate 3 stickman concepts in Nano Banana 2)\n3. Test scene production (cold open, two versions)\n4. Script revision (DEFERRED until after visual tests)\n\n### Skills to Re-Read\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\anti-sycophancy\\SKILL.md` — ALWAYS active. Mandatory for all responses to Priyanshu.\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\omni-flash-policy-bypass\\SKILL.md` — Required for the immediate prompt-writing task.\n- `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\config\\skills\\ai-ad-prompt-guide\\SKILL.md` — Required for the immediate prompt-writing task.\n\nYou have the 2 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1787394998695]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b21b73f6-5fab-403b-b34a-7fa7a2b453a7/.user_uploaded/media_1787394998695.png\nLast Edited: 2026-08-22T10:38:58Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media__1787335872123]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b21b73f6-5fab-403b-b34a-7fa7a2b453a7/.user_uploaded/media__1787335872123.png\nLast Edited: 2026-08-21T19:33:22Z\n\n# Conversation Logs\n\nReference the following log files for the full, untruncated conversation:\n\n- C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b21b73f6-5fab-403b-b34a-7fa7a2b453a7\\.system_generated\\logs\\transcript.jsonl\n\n**IMPORTANT: this summary is just for your reference. You may respond to my previous and future messages, but DO NOT ACKNOWLEDGE THIS CHECKPOINT MESSAGE. JUST READ IT BUT DO NOT MENTION IT, RESPOND TO IT, OR TAKE ACTION BECAUSE OF IT.**"}
